                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "29037bce-e59d-320f-8067-d10a3c699801",
                        "entry_id": "6bbd38f9-cb54-32fb-84b4-9b34cb211420",
                        "glosses": [
                            "eng an den als real anerkannten Bedingungen und Möglichkeiten orientierte Politik"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "84d0609b-2452-41cb-9ba8-c0aee38b5c22",
                                "sense_id": "29037bce-e59d-320f-8067-d10a3c699801",
                                "text": "Niccolò Machiavelli gilt als bedeutendster Verfechter einer Realpolitik, die sich nicht an religiösen oder ethischen Erwägungen orientiert."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f415d85-74db-4671-b1c5-20bab178d597",
                                "sense_id": "29037bce-e59d-320f-8067-d10a3c699801",
                                "text": "Bei den Grünen gibt es Verfechter einer Realpolitik und auf der anderen Seite die Fundis."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3134337d-bbc5-48d8-ae67-a285bb9e1533",
                        "source_entry_id": "6bbd38f9-cb54-32fb-84b4-9b34cb211420",
                        "source_sense_id": "29037bce-e59d-320f-8067-d10a3c699801",
                        "source_sense_description": "eng an den als real anerkannten Bedingungen und Möglichkeiten orientierte Politik",
                        "target_lang_word": "realpolitik",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "realpolitik",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a3c3ee4-e61f-3989-9e03-2951c98f77b4",
                                        "entry_id": "915abc39-07b3-35e3-8519-2314bcd66d13",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pragmatic, often expansionist, diplomacy and politics focused on perceived national interests of the state to the near exclusion of ethical, moral, and theoretical objectives."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2dd23aa-9dfc-47f1-a5f0-db6988e9d1ac",
                                                "sense_id": "2a3c3ee4-e61f-3989-9e03-2951c98f77b4",
                                                "text": "It is Realpolitik in sport, and a Realpolitik which is not wholly unknown in England; but while the spirit of Realpolitik is still perceivable in German sport, it is equally perceivable that the standard English way of viewing sporting competition is becoming more and more approached in Germany."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "518af763-f870-47a9-8e5d-c64f3d8725d0",
                                                "sense_id": "2a3c3ee4-e61f-3989-9e03-2951c98f77b4",
                                                "text": "Possibly the Germans themselves regard their Realpolitik as but the continuation of the philosophic tradition of disillusionment: like Xenophanes they would remind us that the gods of the Ethiopians are snub-nosed and swart, of the Thracians blue-eyed and red-haired, and that if oxen had gods their gods would be oxen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bcdc785-9834-423f-8fac-fa5696f309f2",
                                                "sense_id": "2a3c3ee4-e61f-3989-9e03-2951c98f77b4",
                                                "text": "Realpolitik, in one or another form, is, therefore, from the standpoint of science and of abstract principle, immoral, unsound and no defense of it on the ground of concrete necessity can make it otherwise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "beb79f90-4418-47d4-8965-52ee91480c0a",
                                                "sense_id": "2a3c3ee4-e61f-3989-9e03-2951c98f77b4",
                                                "text": "Twenty-first century nation states will no longer tolerate even the mild humiliation of hosting the detritus of 18th- and 19th-century empires. Most European empires were born of the realpolitik of power, mostly the treaties of Utrecht (1713) and Paris (1763). The same realpolitik now ordains their dismantling. An early purpose of the United Nations was to bring this about."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "81535519-1ace-4866-9354-3cd8acd7e61e",
                        "source_entry_id": "6bbd38f9-cb54-32fb-84b4-9b34cb211420",
                        "source_sense_id": "29037bce-e59d-320f-8067-d10a3c699801",
                        "source_sense_description": "eng an den als real anerkannten Bedingungen und Möglichkeiten orientierte Politik",
                        "target_lang_word": "realpolitik",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "realpolitik",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81b29281-bd15-33c4-bee7-fcfce45d5151",
                                        "entry_id": "d3f77fb8-08d2-3bed-ada2-9a3e541a8303",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Doctrine de politique étrangère fondée sur une utilisation rationnelle de la diplomatie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f09ffa0f-1292-4bdc-9f9a-75aac845b234",
                                                "sense_id": "81b29281-bd15-33c4-bee7-fcfce45d5151",
                                                "text": "La realpolitik, vouée aux gémonies dans les années 1920 et 1930, revint à la mode."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4100fadc-39a8-47c0-ae38-ec4faac3b579",
                                                "sense_id": "81b29281-bd15-33c4-bee7-fcfce45d5151",
                                                "text": "Mais les principes sont une chose, la realpolitik en est une autre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e600041-6c81-48b1-9b42-3ce011542a26",
                                                "sense_id": "81b29281-bd15-33c4-bee7-fcfce45d5151",
                                                "text": "Une fois en place, la realpolitik et les faits vous rattrapent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
